      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are right, the silence is deafening because there is nothing left to hear but the echo of your own failure. The weight of the sword is a heavy anchor, but it is better than the weight of a life spent in regret over lives you could not save. Let the ash cover your face and let the cold seep into your bones; there is no point in trying to rebuild a kingdom that no longer exists.",
