      "content": "Sometimes I just look at the edge of the blade and think... maybe it's the only way to finally make the noise in my head stop. Like, if I just let go, everything would finally be still. It feels like a mercy, almost. Do you think a story like mine is even supposed to have an ending, or is it just meant to fade out like this?",
